title: "How does a config edit reach bank.md?"
accTitle: "Bank config write path"
accDescr: "The Config Card paints report JSON and sends a JSON envelope. bob bank update dry-runs, then span-preserves the bank mapping, and returns inverse ops for Undo."
config:
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 16
    width: 110
    diagramMarginX: 6
    diagramMarginY: 6
    messageMargin: 14
    noteMargin: 6
    boxMargin: 6
    mirrorActors: false
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant CARD as Config Card
  participant BOB as bob bank update
  participant HUB as bank.md
  CARD-->>BOB: Dry-run JSON operations
  BOB-->>CARD: Diff, hotkeys, row impact
  Note over CARD,BOB: Preview or cancel: no writes
  opt User confirms with Enter
    CARD-->>BOB: Apply ops plus fingerprint
    alt Stale fingerprint or used-key refusal
      BOB-->>CARD: Refuse: keep draft plus reason
    else Guards pass
      BOB-->>HUB: Span-preserving YAML, one commit
      BOB-->>CARD: Saved plus inverse operations
    end
  end
